# Agent sync (Cursor)

Framework: **cursor**. Protocol: `.agent/SYNC.md`

Session start: `Read .cursor/prompts/session-start.md and execute it.`
Session end: `Read .cursor/prompts/session-end.md and execute it.`

Do not edit `.claude/`, `.agents/`, `.codex/`, `.opencode/`.
